  "description": "High-performance CSV, XLSX and PDF exporting library for .NET 8+ built on CsvHelper, SpreadCheetah and PDFsharp. Convention-based with fluent ExportRule API, supports async streaming, multi-sheet XLSX (1M+ rows), paginated PDF tables with automatic layout and embedded fonts, auto-zip for large files, column formatting, decimal precision, enum handling, and minimal API integration. Zero-config with intelligent defaults.",
